/P 95 0 R
/T ( Tarapada arrives unexpectedly with a group of travelling performers. He is a talented and charming boy, gifted in music, singing, and performance. Although he easily adapts to different places and people, he does not belong permanently anywhere. His love for rivers, forests, and the open world shows his deep connection to nature and his desire for freedom rather than a settled life.)
/E ( Tarapada arrives unexpectedly with a group of travelling performers. He is a talented and charming boy, gifted in music, singing, and performance. Although he easily adapts to different places and people, he does not belong permanently anywhere. His love for rivers, forests, and the open world shows his deep connection to nature and his desire for freedom rather than a settled life.)
