/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (A wealthy zamindar family warmly welcomes Tarapada into their home. They educate him, care for him, and treat him like their own son. Because of his intelligence, musical skills, and pleasant nature, he quickly becomes loved by everyone in the household. Eventually, the family even decides to arrange his marriage with their daughter, hoping to give him stability and make his stay permanent.)
